# Layout grid (mobile 8 / desktop 12)

- Wrap sections in `LayoutGrid` → `layout-frame` → `layout-grid` (`.grid-8` + `.layout-grid`).
- **Mobile:** 8 columns, margin `var(--layout-margin)`, Figma 1277×2776 scale via `--vf`.
- **Desktop (`data-viewport="web"`):** 12 columns; edge inset `--web-edge` only; `--grid-gutter` 36–56px; profile = `(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)`.
- Full-width children: `span-8` (both breakpoints) or `grid-column: 1 / -1`.
- On desktop main list, `.font-list-item` spans **6** (2-up) or **4** (3-up ≥1800px) — see `web-desktop.css`.

## Avoid

- Ad-hoc `max-width` + `margin: auto` outside the grid.
- Separate desktop-only landing UI or extra nav — landing uses the mobile partition canvas on all viewports.
- `display: contents` on list containers when entries must sit on the grid (guestbook list).
